    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Runbook",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### FedCSL observability runbook\n\n- **Exporter**: `python -m observability.exporter --root observability/runs --port 9108` (host)\n- **Local closed loop**: `python -m observability.pipeline --dataset Epilepsy-TSTCC --num-rounds 2`\n- **Argo**: `kubectl -n argo create -f deploy/argo/workflowtemplate.yaml` then `argo submit -n argo --from workflowtemplate/fedcsl-pipeline`\n- **Artifacts**: `observability/runs/<run_id>/` contains `dataset.json`, `progress.json`, `stages/*.json`, `logs/*.log`, `eval_summary.json`\n- **Result logs**: `result/<dataset>/*.txt`"
      }
